<title>UK: Kingfisher half-year profits leap 46.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher half-year profits leap 46.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to August 3 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.7		   vs 8.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.0		    vs 4.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     109.6		  vs 74.6</p>
<p> Retail sales	     2,503.7		vs 2,268.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 97.0 to 115.0 million stg.</p>
</text>
